Z||000000||Clint||09-24-1999||01:15 PM||||Can anyone give me any further information on the Pyrahna kit for the Fiero.<BR>I know they stopped making the kit several years ago.  What i don't know is if the plans are avaiable to have it custom built?  who designed it. How many were made. Why on earth they stopped building it. (it's the best kit i've ever seen, and i've seen a lot of kits)  I would love to get a hold of the original forms or convince another kit manuf. to get a hold of them and start making the kit again.<P>later<BR>clint<BR>||||reg||5
